# Proto names and tags

- RPC: `VerbNoun`. Messages: `VerbNounRequest` / `VerbNounResponse`.
- Fields: `snake_case`.
- Append new field numbers. Never reuse or renumber.
- `option csharp_namespace` is `RutDigital.Contracts.{Project}.{Service}` from `protos/{project}/{service}/`. Same folder, same option. Do not rename other services.

```protobuf
option csharp_namespace = "RutDigital.Contracts.{Project}.{Service}";

rpc CreatePage (CreatePageRequest)
    returns (CreatePageResponse);

message CreatePageRequest {
  Page page = 1;
}
```
